{"body":"Adds `submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/`. **Front: direct.**\n\nGo 1.27.2, `pgx/v5` (`pgconn` only), no web framework.\n\n- Own HTTP/1.1 server on `net`, one goroutine per connection, one write per response.\n- Batched reads: requests of the same kind that queue while all read connections are busy go out as one `LATERAL`-over-`unnest()` statement; each request's rows come from its own execution of its own query, tagged with its ordinal. No timer; batches grow only under load.\n- Group-committed writes on separate connections (one extended-protocol batch, one `Sync`, one WAL flush); every response waits for the commit; a failed group is rolled back by Postgres and retried one request at a time.\n- Reference SQL with the page of ids cut before the per-article work; session-level `SET`s only.\n- Own bcrypt (cost 10, `$2a$`) with the Blowfish key schedule interleaved over up to four hashes; tested against `golang.org/x/crypto/bcrypt` in both directions.\n\nPasses `test/run.sh` 197/197 locally. Details, rules compliance and local numbers are in the README.","closedAt":null,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-23T16:39:05Z","files":[{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/.gitignore","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/LICENSE-x-crypto","additions":27,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/README.md","additions":129,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/bcrypt.go","additions":333,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/bcrypt_lanes.go","additions":1091,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/bcrypt_pi.go","additions":198,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/bcrypt_test.go","additions":116,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/build.sh","additions":10,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/db.go","additions":644,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/gen_bcrypt.py","additions":38,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/go.mod","additions":14,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/go.sum","additions":28,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/handlers.go","additions":721,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/http.go","additions":282,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/http_test.go","additions":44,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/install.sh","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/jsonw.go","additions":158,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/jwt.go","additions":268,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/main.go","additions":103,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/sql.go","additions":536,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/start.sh","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/go-raw-kimmotamio/wire.go","additions":100,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"}],"headRefName":"go-raw-kimmotamio","headRefOid":"70bc115179047d7d729807956a24124b5a0f3c2b","headRepository":{"id":"R_kgDOVU_R5g","name":"multicore-server-challenge","nameWithOwner":"kimmotamio/multicore-server-challenge"},"headRepositoryOwner":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDM3MDU1","name":"Kimmo Tamio","login":"kimmotamio"},"isDraft":false,"mergedAt":null,"number":37,"reviews":[],"state":"OPEN","title":"Add go-raw-kimmotamio: Go, own HTTP server, batched reads, group commit, interleaved bcrypt","updatedAt":"2026-10-23T20:14:30Z","url":"https://github.com/arjaythedev/multicore-server-challenge/pull/37"}
